OL,3,GNEWSANew red route could be introduced
OL,4,Ain parts of Bristol
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new red route which bans drivers from
OL,7,Fstopping at any time could be
OL,8,Fintroduced to address road safety
OL,9,Fconcerns.
OL,11,FBristol City Council is proposing to
OL,12,Fuse double red lines in Bedminster and
OL,13,FRedcliffe.
OL,15,FCouncillor Ed Plowden, chair of the
OL,16,Ftransport and connectivity committee,
OL,17,Fsaid it would "help keep Bristol on the
OL,18,Fmove, tackling congestion and making
OL,19,Fbus journeys faster and more reliable".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
