OL,3,GNEWSANew red route could be introduced
OL,4,Ain parts of Bristol
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Better public transport gives
OL,7,Fpeople a genuine alternative to
OL,8,Fdriving, helping us create a cleaner
OL,9,Fcity, improve air quality and build a
OL,10,Fbetter connected transport network."
